  "\"Pantoprazole 40mg\" (page 1) and \"Pantoprazole 40 mg tab\" (page 2) linked as one": "“Pantoprazole 40mg” (पान 1) आणि “Pantoprazole 40 mg tab” (पान 2) एक म्हणून जोडले",
  "An uncertain match would be put to you instead": "अनिश्चित जुळणी तुम्हाला विचारली गेली असती",
