  "Show the reasoning": "तर्क दाखवा",
  "Criterion by criterion, with what was checked and what could not be.": "निकषागणिक, काय तपासले आणि काय तपासता आले नाही.",
  "Point to the next step": "पुढील पाऊल सांगा",
